  m_text: 'Welcome to Lab 4: A Terrible Day in the Office

    To finish your working
    day, you need to complete the following tasks:


    - File all files in their
    correct drawers


    - Throw the trash in the bin


    - Pour yourself a full
    cup of coffee


    - Wipe your desk clean with the sponge ( I WANT TO KMS)


    You
    can start completing the tasks once you click the start button, once all tasks
    are completed, press the quit button.'
